   "departmentNumber" : "24",
   "description" : "<div class=\"product-details-wrapper-au\">\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">TV Size</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">32 - 65 Inch</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Capacity</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">Up to 27kg</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Height</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">Adjust up to 8&quot;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Swivel</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">20&deg; / -20&deg;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Roll</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">3&deg; / -3&deg;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Brand</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">SANUS Simplicity</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Model</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">SSTV2-B1</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tag\">\n<div>\n<h5 class=\"product-tag-keyword\">Colour</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"product-tag-dsc\">Black</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-detail-dsc-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"product-detail-title-wrapper\">\n<h5 class=\"product-detail-title\">Description</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-detail-dsc\">This Swivelling TV Base is a tabletop TV base that recreates the sleek look and feel of a mounted TV. The swivelling TV Base provides up to 8 inches of height adjustability creating space to fit a sound bar below your TV.<br />\n<br />\nTV not included</div>\n\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
